  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThere is a WHATNOT scheduled for today at 10:00 CET. We will be tagging issues for the next call again using [agenda+](https://github.com/whatwg/html/labels/agenda%2B) in all WHATWG repositories across [issues](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=issues) and [pull requests](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=pullrequests) and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to join us.",
